  <item>
    <title>东方神起1.0 Mixtape</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af2f0285b7c4709bfe40865</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af2f0285b7c4709bfe40865</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:26:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtkFIImdD-i3HzeIvTHrGE703o8U.jpg"><p><span>献给我的青春，</span><br><span>借着 JX 的巡演，重新梳理一遍 1.0 时期五人的歌。挑出这些安稳明亮的作品，收录进这张 mixtape。</span></p><p><span>年少懵懂时，不识何为和声，不懂何谓唱功，只因颜值坠入东神。耳边长年浸润着这些质感上乘的歌，抒情或是唱跳，回头才发觉，我自小听见的，已是顶配。放到现在，依旧难得。</span><br></p><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Thanks To</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 像现在一样</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> My Destiny</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 你，无论何时</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> My Little Princess</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> Eternal</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 你是我的歌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> Tea for Two</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> I Wish</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2257">37:37</a> Love Is</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> Stay With Me Tonight</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">45:58</a> Hi Ya Ya</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> White Lie</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3237">53:57</a> One</span></p><p></p><p><br></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61e51c762cb2806d0e5ddc62/lsmajQvDKmmKMLI6U6Vdebeszgdy.m4a" length="56290013" type="audio/mp4"/>
