  <item>
    <title>独自美丽的祁紫檀Mixtape</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aab620f9d326477816a6c3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aab620f9d326477816a6c3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>距离上一次看祁紫檀专场已经过去五年。再度听见她，唱功与音乐的艺术性都沉淀得更为动人。这些年常常感慨，她始终没能大火，像一颗被低估的音乐遗珠。音综音乐节舞台上也鲜少见到她的身影，可她的音乐那样灵动、自由，带着独一份的美丽质感，值得被更多人听见。</span><br></p><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 爱之颤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a> Dear Friend</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 别融化在空气里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> 小城女孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> Soft Hands</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 未来玫瑰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 独自美丽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1670">27:50</a> 相信爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a> 后青年启示录</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a> 无归属的她</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 我说你像一只可爱的小狗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 没有如果</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3008">50:08</a> 难忘那夜色如水荡漾</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> 仍存在的恐惧心理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3531">58:51</a> 随风去</span></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
