    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>了结多年的一个心愿，广仲的现场真的太赞了。声音很有颗粒感和层次感，穿透力也足，坐在现场听特别过瘾，也特别治愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他在台上说：第一次来听我演唱会的朋友，听了第一次就会来第二次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在台下疯狂点头。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhItnyXwQm6V5CqquScjm3T4_nyM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>很幸运一到场馆，就碰到广仲来上班了～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft9YSGTmRScIurtcmb2fsqfHxfZZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1. 雨时多云偶阵晴</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>2. 蓝宝</span><br><span>3. 别杀我</span><br><span>4. 二十四小时柒天</span><br><span>5. 死在你的胸怀</span><br><span>6. 明年</span><br><span>7. Nice to Meet You</span><br><span>8. 慢灵魂</span><br><span>9. 再见勾勾</span><br><span>10. 风雨</span><br><span>11. 破气球</span><br><span>12. Que te pasa 你在干嘛？</span><br><span>13. OH YEAH</span><br><span>14. 夏天的歌</span><br><span>15. 早安，晨之美</span><br><span>16. 天然的最好</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>祝各位收听愉快💐</span></p>]]></description>
