  <item>
    <title>首尔冬天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/697b21232fc7f49d09e37e2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">697b21232fc7f49d09e37e2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到首尔的冬天，脑海里第一时间浮现的画面，总是和《请回答1988》有关。</span></p><p><span>说来也巧，前段时间，刚好赶上这部剧十周年。看到屏幕里“双门洞”的伙伴们重新聚在一起录制综艺，隔着屏幕都能感觉到那份熟稔的温暖。这个契机，让我心里那点关于1988的念想，又被轻轻勾了起来。</span></p><p><span>本来，我并没有打算重看的。总觉得有些记忆，就该妥帖地封存在过去，反复触碰反而会失了最初的味道。可看完综艺那份百感交集的心情，像冬日里呵出的一团白气，明明已经消散，寒意却还留在皮肤上。最终，还是没忍住，在一个普通的夜晚，又一次按下了播放键。</span></p><p><span>当再看一遍时，恍然意识到屏幕上的一切未曾改变，改变的，是屏幕外这个已经走过一段人生的自己。</span></p><p><span>这个冬天，如果你也想念某种温度，不妨点开这个歌单。</span></p><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span></strong><span>Magic Castle - 东方神起</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> </span></strong><span>向我走来的路 - 成始璄</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> </span></strong><span>Day &amp; Night - 郑承焕</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="717">11:57</a> </span></strong><span>Snowfall at Night - D.O.</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a></span></strong><span> YOUR SONG - SAM KIM,李珍雅,郑承焕</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> </span></strong><span>all day - George</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> </span></strong><span>过的如何 - Crush</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> </span></strong><span>in the bed - 鲜于贞娥</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> </span></strong><span>소망 - As One</span><br></p><p><span>祝各位收听愉快～💐</span></p><p><span>策划&amp;制作：Giantblue </span><br><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c47bf0000000001b025172" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c47bf0000000001b025172"><span>Groove Nest</span></a></p>]]></description>
