  <item>
    <title>漫步，在雪落之前</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696b64e4ef1cf272a7e51971</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696b64e4ef1cf272a7e51971</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每日出门，冷风“呼”地蹭过脸颊。</span><br><span>走在路上，如果不给耳朵里放点声音，世界就静得太认真了。</span></p><p><span>这种静法，很像雪落前的天空：</span><br><span>灰灰的，软软的，万物都轻轻收着气息，像在等待什么轻盈的东西缓缓降临。</span></p><p><span>这时候听的歌，声音要刚好。不吵，也不过分安静。得像水渗进纸那样，顺着这份安静的纹路，慢慢地洇开。</span><br><br><span>不管是通勤路上、漫步，或是睡前，</span><br><span>天冷的时候，想暖和一点又不想说话的时候，这些歌就适合在耳机里陪着你。</span><br></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgnHrdDqoguTpQVYpownokraD6FV.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Kate Stewart - Back Home</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 关浩德Walter - 老地方见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> Olivia Ong - Sweet Memories</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> Juwita Suwito - Breathe Again</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 卫兰 - In Love Again</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 东方神起 - 약속했던 그때에 (Always There…)</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> Rad Museum,MISO - ANOTHER MAN</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> Laura day romance - Sleeping pills &nbsp;眠り薬</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 苏秀彬 - 사랑의 소동</span><strong><span>（</span></strong><span>Love Happening）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 藤井風 - Time After Time</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> Half Moon Run - Warmest Regards</span><br><br><span>祝各位收听愉快～💐</span></p><p><span>策划&amp;制作：Giantblue </span><br><span>小红书：@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c47bf0000000001b025172" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62c47bf0000000001b025172"><span>Groove Nest</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/61e51c762cb2806d0e5ddc62/ljLMycjNhqFSOt3OmtxaSSNQgFK_.m4a" length="36608986" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoMTc9_1k_ZcES_XnuE3kBqvCppY.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>2026，从Chill开始</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695a410a6d3ad49786b6e441</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695a410a6d3ad49786b6e441</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Jan 2026 10:51:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>26年的第一期，想送给大家一份“放松”。</span></p><p><span>不是什么都不做，而是带着一份“度假心情”——哪怕手头还有工作，窗外还是熟悉的街景，但只要戴上耳机，心里就有一片自己的沙滩，有晒得暖乎乎的风。</span></p><p><span>用这样一份好心情开启的一年，一定会有点不一样。不是非要做出什么惊天动地的事，而是可以更从容、更轻快地，去迎接生活里的一切。无论好的，坏的，意外的惊喜，或是需要多等一等的期待。</span></p><p><span>新的一年已经启程，</span><br><span>愿各位的心里，永远有这样一片随时可以抵达的沙滩，</span><br><span>2026，一起chill出发。</span></p><p><br><strong><span>Playlist</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Yogee New Waves - Toromi Days</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="266">04:26</a> Banda Black Rio - De Onde Vem</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> Holy Hive - Hypnosis</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> Me and My Sandcastle - Drift Away</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a> KYOZO &amp; BUN - 真冬のアロハ・パーティー</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> 王若琳 - Ragged Stairs to Heaven &nbsp;The End</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1248">20:48</a> Glowy - Knots</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 旺福 - Goodbye My Friend</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> Buena Vista Social Club - Amor de Loca Juventud</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1837">30:37</a> Yogee New Waves - PRISM HEART</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> CAGNET,Anna McMurphy - Deeper And Deeper</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2385">39:45</a> Donald Austin - Crazy Legs</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 100% Pure Poison - You Keep Coming Back</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
